%% Sequence: Manager's registration-period request, the Admin's wizard and publication
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Mg as Manager
  actor Ad as Administrator
  participant TR as TermRequestService
  participant IV as InventoryService (room codes)
  participant W as TermWizardService
  participant TL as TermTimelines
  participant TD as TermDifferences
  participant AN as AnnouncementService (NTF)
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Mg->>IV: POST /inventory/room-codes (Excel / CSV of Rooms left out)
  IV-->>Mg: Rooms found, unknown codes
  Mg->>TR: POST /term-requests {dates, milestones, Blocks, Rooms, places, prices}
  TR->>DB: insert cfg_term_request (Submitted), Admin notified
  Ad->>W: POST /admin/terms/drafts {requestId}
  W->>DB: insert cfg_term (Draft) filled from the request, request In progress
  loop steps 1–6
    Ad->>W: PUT /admin/terms/{id}/wizard/{step}
    W->>TL: check(timeline)
    W->>TD: of(request, draft) — a reason for each value that differs
    W->>DB: save the step
  end
  Ad->>W: POST /admin/terms/{id}/publish
  W->>DB: Term Published, prices, Deposit, Utility Deposit and rules fixed
  W->>TR: done(request), Manager told every value that changed
  W-->>AN: PolicyChanged / Term published
  AN->>DB: announcements on the dormitory board (EN + VI)
